<Defs>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>Hediff_SSC_PersonalityExcreting</defName>
    <label>人格排泄准备中</label>
    <description>从肛门注射的PNA开始发挥作用，收集个体的人格（灵魂）并准备排泄。</description>
    <hediffClass>SexSlaveCraft.Hediff_SSC_PersonalityExcreting</hediffClass>
    <tendable>false</tendable>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.8, 0.4, 0.4)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1.0</maxSeverity>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HediffCompProperties_SeverityPerDay">
        <severityPerDay>0.3</severityPerDay>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>初期</label>
        <minSeverity>0.0</minSeverity>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>中期</label>
        <minSeverity>0.25</minSeverity>
        <capMods>
          <li><capacity>Consciousness</capacity><offset>-0.05</offset></li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>后期</label>
        <minSeverity>0.50</minSeverity>
        <capMods>
          <li><capacity>Consciousness</capacity><offset>-0.10</offset></li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>排泄临界</label>
        <minSeverity>0.75</minSeverity>
        <capMods>
          <li>
            <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
            <offset>-0.20</offset> </li>
        </capMods>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <HediffDef>
    <defName>Hediff_SSC_PersonalityExcreted_Done</defName>
    <label>人格排泄(完成)</label>
    <description>人格被排空，有以前的全部记忆（不会影响当前初始人格），由PNA组成的初始人格将代替原主进行一系列的生命活动，且原主人格凝胶仍会和身体共感。</description>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.5, 0.5, 0.5)</defaultLabelColor>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <tendable>false</tendable>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <stages>
      <li>
      <pctAllThoughtNullification>1</pctAllThoughtNullification>
      
      <overrideMoodBase>0.5</overrideMoodBase> 
      
      <blocksMentalBreaks>true</blocksMentalBreaks>
      
      <blocksInspirations>true</blocksInspirations>
        <capMods>
        <li>
          <capacity>Consciousness</capacity>
          <setMax>0.6</setMax> </li>
        <li>
          <capacity>Moving</capacity>
          <setMax>0.8</setMax> </li>
        </capMods>
        <statOffsets>
           <GlobalLearningFactor>-1.0</GlobalLearningFactor>
           <SocialImpact>-0.5</SocialImpact>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
<ThoughtDef>
    <defName>Hediff_PersonalityExcreting_Thought</defName>
    <workerClass>ThoughtWorker_Hediff</workerClass>
    <hediff>Hediff_SSC_PersonalityExcreting</hediff>
    <validWhileDespawned>true</validWhileDespawned>
    <stages>
      
      <li>
        <label>我的肚子好胀</label>
        <description>我的肛门被注射了某种液体，凉凉的，塞满了我的肚子，好难受。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>-5</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>

      <li>
        <label>脑袋昏昏</label>
        <description>我的意识开始变得有些模糊，每次随着呼吸，我都能感觉到那团粘液在直肠里晃动，这种令人羞耻的异物感让我无法集中精神思考。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>-8</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>

      <li>
        <label>好难受</label>
        <description>思考变得好困难...好想把身体里的那坨东西拉出来，可我必须憋住。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>-10</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>

      <li>
        <label>嗝...啊哈哈哈，唔！！</label>
        <description>不行，大脑已经空了，好想拉出来，好想被艹。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>20</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

</Defs>
